---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Reviews
heading: What customers say
standfirst: Real reviews from real customers, pulled live from Google. We do not edit them and we cannot remove them.
description: "Google reviews of IT Surgery from customers in Penarth, Barry and Cardiff: friendly, plain-English IT help, fixed prices, no fix no fee."
---

<section class="section">
  <div class="container narrow">
    {# Filled by /assets/reviews.js from the n8n endpoint in site.json. The
       markup below is the no-JavaScript and fetch-failed state: still a page,
       still a link to Google, never a blank. #}
    <div class="reviews-summary" data-reviews-summary hidden>
      <span class="reviews-stars" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span class="reviews-score"></span>
      <a class="reviews-google" href="{{ site.googleProfileUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read all reviews on Google<span class="visually-hidden"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a>
    </div>

    <ul class="reviews-list" data-reviews-list hidden></ul>

    <p class="reviews-fallback" data-reviews-fallback>
      Our reviews are on Google:
      <a href="{{ site.googleProfileUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">read them there<span class="visually-hidden"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a>.
    </p>

    {% if testimonials.items.length %}
    <h2>In their own words</h2>
    <ul class="reviews-list">
      {% for t in testimonials.items %}
      <li class="review">
        <blockquote class="review-text">{{ t.quote }}</blockquote>
        <p class="review-meta">{{ t.name }}{% if t.town %}, {{ t.town }}{% endif %}</p>
      </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
    {% endif %}

    <div class="cta-panel">
      <h2>Been a customer?</h2>
      <p>
        A review helps other people in {{ site.areas | join(", ") }} find us.
        <a href="{{ site.reviewUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Leave a Google review<span class="visually-hidden"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a>
        - it takes a minute.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script src="{{ '/assets/reviews.js' | v }}" data-endpoint="{{ site.reviewsEndpoint }}" defer></script>
